 bouldering, or an outdoor court—and review access rules first.","short_summary":"A structured Saturday start with several indoor and outdoor activity choices.","evidence_claim":"CSUSB lists a fitness floor, indoor court, climbing and bouldering wall, studios, tennis courts, basketball courts, fields, and sand volleyball at the center.","source_url":"https://www.csusb.edu/guided-tour/student-recreation-wellness-center","source_title":"Student Recreation & Wellness Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Current summer weekend hours are listed as 8 a.m.–3 p.m.; enrolled-student access is included in tuition.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csusb-coussoulis-arena","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"James and Aerianthi Coussoulis Arena","title":"Locate the Coyotes’ Home Court","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Coussoulis Arena","notes":"Walk around the arena exterior and note the nearby athletic fields; enter only for a scheduled event with valid access.","short_summary":"A daylight orientation stop connecting the arena with CSUSB’s athletic grounds.","evidence_claim":"CSUSB identifies Coussoulis Arena as the home of its volleyball and basketball teams and notes nearby softball, soccer, and cross-country fields.","source_url":"https://www.csusb.edu/guided-tour/james-and-aerianthi-coussoulis-arena","source_title":"James and Aerianthi Coussoulis Arena","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Exterior orientation is flexible; interior entry depends on the event schedule, ticketing, and venue rules.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csusb-murillo-family-observatory","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Murillo Family Observatory","title"